&lt;p&gt;We were a bit worried about this one but it proved to be a quick find using other cachers context photos and some lath and flagging too &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;. We had never been to this town before so we went and explored it a bit before heading back to Killam to continue on our way south using Hwy 36.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap ofth, we do enjoy visiting all these small Alberta towns.&lt;/p&gt;

