My GPSr: N52° 46.348' W111° 41.233'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was my first cap find of the day on a round about route from Edmonton to Drumheller. After parking on the nearby road I made my way across the open field toward the tracks and the guide post and thanks to previous context photos, I was able to locate the cap quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

